## 2. End-to-End Flow & 4 Concrete Stages

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    A[Input Image] --> B[DetectionStage\npaddleocr_det_module.py]
    B --> C[Detection JSON\npaddleocr_det_output/*_det.json]
    C --> D[CropExtractionStage\ncrops_extraction.py]
    A --> D
    D --> E[Crops Folder & Manifest\ncrops/<image_stem>/ & crops_manifest.json]
    E --> F[RecognitionStage + ONNX & Batching\npaddleocr_recognition_module.py]
    F --> G[Full Recog JSON\nrecog_full_results.json]
    F --> H[Filtered Recog JSON\nfinal_recog.json]
    G --> I[CLIPFilteringStage + Batching\nCLIP_filtering.py]
    
    subgraph Tiered Re-checking Logic
        I --> J{Rec Confidence?}
        J -- "Conf >= high_thresh (0.85)" --> K[Keep: KEPT_HIGH_CONF]
        J -- "Conf < low_thresh (0.20)" --> L[Reject: REJECTED_LOW_REC]
        J -- "low <= Conf < high" --> M[CLIP Classifier Batch]
        M -- "Non-Text & CLIP Conf >= clip_thresh" --> N[Reject: REJECTED_CLIP_NON_TEXT]
        M -- "Text / Low Non-Text Conf" --> O[Keep: KEPT_CLIP_TEXT]
    end
    
    K --> P[Final Verified JSON & Annotated Debug Render]
    O --> P
```

